<LegalLayout
  title="Contact | TripAxle"
  description="How to reach TripAxle with corrections, questions, or feedback about the Portugal car rental guides."
  heading="Contact"
>
  <p>
    A proper contact form is on the way. This page will be updated with it, and
    with a direct email address, shortly.
  </p>

  <h2>In the meantime</h2>
  <p>
    The most useful thing you can send us is a <strong>correction</strong>. If a
    guide is out of date, a shuttle point has moved, a fee has changed, or a link
    is broken, telling us helps the next traveler who lands on the same page.
    Notes on what was unclear or missing are just as welcome.
  </p>
  <p>
    We are not able to answer questions about a specific booking, quote, or
    dispute — for that, your rental company or the booking site you used is the
    right contact. What we can do is explain how something generally works, and
    point you to the part of the guide that covers it.
  </p>

  <h2>Media, advertising and partnerships</h2>
  <p>
    We welcome enquiries about advertising, media, affiliate arrangements, and
    other commercial partnerships. Advertising and any sponsored material are
    kept clearly separate from TripAxle's independent travel guidance.
  </p>
  <p>
    We do not accept payment for a favourable review, recommendation, ranking, or
    editorial conclusion, or run paid coverage without labelling it. The full
    policy is in the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.
    Partnership enquiries can be raised here once the contact form is live.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
